<template>
  <section>
    <h2 class="pdx-txt-heading section-heading">5. JSON vs Declarative</h2>
    <div class="comparison-table">
      <div class="cmp-header"><span>Aspect</span><span>JSON Schema</span><span>Declarative Template</span></div>
      <div class="cmp-row"><span>Best for</span><span>Backend-driven, dynamic forms</span><span>Known, static forms</span></div>
      <div class="cmp-row"><span>Nested objects</span><span><code>type: 'group'</code></span><span><code>&lt;pdx-field-group&gt;</code></span></div>
      <div class="cmp-row"><span>Arrays</span><span><code>type: 'list'</code></span><span><code>&lt;pdx-field-list&gt;</code></span></div>
      <div class="cmp-row"><span>Validation</span><span><code>required: true, validators: [...]</code></span><span><code>validators: { 'path': [...] }</code></span></div>
      <div class="cmp-row"><span>Layout</span><span>Grid columns via <code>size</code></span><span>CSS classes in template</span></div>
      <div class="cmp-row"><span>Sections</span><span><code>sections: [...]</code></span><span><code>&lt;pdx-form-section&gt;</code></span></div>
      <div class="cmp-row"><span>Compiler binding</span><span>N/A (runtime)</span><span>Auto (:value, @change, @blur)</span></div>
      <div class="cmp-row"><span>Wizard</span><span><code>layout: 'wizard'</code></span><span>Manual step logic</span></div>
      <div class="cmp-row"><span>Display modes</span><span>Planned</span><span><code>display="panel|dialog"</code></span></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</template>

